  "body": "Discover modern comfort and effortless living at 4 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa. This brand-new home combines contemporary design, quality finishes and a thoughtfully planned layout, offering a wonderful opportunity to enjoy a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle in a popular coastal community.\r\n\r\nDesigned for practical everyday living, this beautifully presented home features a well-considered single-level layout. The stylish kitchen showcases elegant cabinetry and premium BOSCH appliances, flowing naturally into the dining and living areas to create a welcoming space for everyday living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy seamless indoor-outdoor flow, with the dining and living areas extending effortlessly onto a private rear deck - perfect for summer BBQs, outdoor entertaining or simply relaxing in the sunshine.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Three well-appointed bedrooms & two bathrooms\r\n- Single internal-access garage with integrated laundry\r\n- Premium Bosch kitchen appliances\r\n- Mitsubishi Heavy Industries central air conditioning\r\n- Master Build 10-Year Guarantee\r\n- Low-maintenance lifestyle, single-level living\r\n- Bright and airy interiors with abundant natural light\r\n- Convenient location, close to Orewa Beach, cafe & local amenities\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to secure this exceptional home.\r\n\r\nContact Catherine 02102006788 or Barry 0225067888 today for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\n* Photo Disclaimer: Interior photos are from a similar property and are for illustrative purposes only. Virtual staging for illustrative purposes only.",
